    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919960/extras/c90cffaf7c823354175a7ff69c365d92.poster.avif?t=1736422285\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919960/extras/c90cffaf7c823354175a7ff69c365d92.webm?t=1736422285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919960/extras/c90cffaf7c823354175a7ff69c365d92.mp4?t=1736422285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919960/extras/b4fe617f4ce0b9d6c74b43e831ea665b.avif?t=1736422285\" /></div><br>Decades after our age, Mars has been colonized by an elite leaving the vast majority of our population on a tired Earth, devastated by wars, famines, diseases and other climatic throes.<br>Escaping a certain death, you embody a refugee therapist who joined a humanitarian mission settled on the Moon, the last neutral space, razor edge between life and death for Earth inhabitants.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919960/extras/2d6faad6308769564e68f296bde86aa3.avif?t=1736422285\" /></div><br>In a 2D hand-drawn environment, meet your fellow companions, mingle in the rhythm of the camp and build strong links with the other refugees and volunteers. Through your adventure, learn about your friend\u2019s past, the migration system of the Mars settlers and the dystopian world surrounding us.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919960/extras/9efdaa92cc2e679a58710e04b2a80d81.avif?t=1736422285\" /></div><br>Mysteries and plots will stand on your way to thwart the humanitarian mission. Find clues, gather testimonies and distinguish truth from falsity using logic and all information at your disposal. Unravel the truth about the strange events happening at the camp to preserve the humanitarian aid. Your survival depends on it!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919960/extras/e1813d7cbd0b41eb9493d5d4fa0b3a67.avif?t=1736422285\" /></div><br>Dive into the culprit\u2019s subconscious and drive conversational therapies to help your friends. Ask the good question to guide their spirit, find out their most secret wounds and track down their inner demon to defeat them.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919960/extras/66f3498c3c12a7a839099ac962d01c6c.avif?t=1736422285\" /></div><br>Resist an imperfect migration system, understand the stakes and questions revolving around refugee camp. Will you be strong enough to overtake human mistakes or will you feed the list of collateral damages?",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919960/extras/c90cffaf7c823354175a7ff69c365d92.poster.avif?t=1736422285\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919960/extras/c90cffaf7c823354175a7ff69c365d92.webm?t=1736422285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919960/extras/c90cffaf7c823354175a7ff69c365d92.mp4?t=1736422285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919960/extras/b4fe617f4ce0b9d6c74b43e831ea665b.avif?t=1736422285\" /></div><br>Decades after our age, Mars has been colonized by an elite leaving the vast majority of our population on a tired Earth, devastated by wars, famines, diseases and other climatic throes.<br>Escaping a certain death, you embody a refugee therapist who joined a humanitarian mission settled on the Moon, the last neutral space, razor edge between life and death for Earth inhabitants.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919960/extras/2d6faad6308769564e68f296bde86aa3.avif?t=1736422285\" /></div><br>In a 2D hand-drawn environment, meet your fellow companions, mingle in the rhythm of the camp and build strong links with the other refugees and volunteers. Through your adventure, learn about your friend\u2019s past, the migration system of the Mars settlers and the dystopian world surrounding us.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919960/extras/9efdaa92cc2e679a58710e04b2a80d81.avif?t=1736422285\" /></div><br>Mysteries and plots will stand on your way to thwart the humanitarian mission. Find clues, gather testimonies and distinguish truth from falsity using logic and all information at your disposal. Unravel the truth about the strange events happening at the camp to preserve the humanitarian aid. Your survival depends on it!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919960/extras/e1813d7cbd0b41eb9493d5d4fa0b3a67.avif?t=1736422285\" /></div><br>Dive into the culprit\u2019s subconscious and drive conversational therapies to help your friends. Ask the good question to guide their spirit, find out their most secret wounds and track down their inner demon to defeat them.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919960/extras/66f3498c3c12a7a839099ac962d01c6c.avif?t=1736422285\" /></div><br>Resist an imperfect migration system, understand the stakes and questions revolving around refugee camp. Will you be strong enough to overtake human mistakes or will you feed the list of collateral damages?",
